<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Bata six-month net soars.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Bata six-month net soars.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in millions of rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   18.98     vs	0.85</p>
<p>    Turnover	    666.67     vs    590.95</p>
<p>    Tax provision	13.00     vs	0.69</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Bata Shoe Company of Ceylon Ltd has a significant share of Sri Lanka's footwear market.  </p>
<p>The company is 80 percent owned by Toronto-based Bata International.</p>
<p>-- Colombo Newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
